&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a friendly, organised, and proactive Workplace Coordinator to be the first point of contact for employees, visitors, and vendors. This role supports the day-to-day operations of the office, ensuring a professional, safe, and welcoming workplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Reception &amp;amp; Visitor Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Welcome and assist employees, visitors, contractors, and vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage visitor sign-in procedures and access control requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a professional and organised reception area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Office Operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate courier deliveries and collections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage office supplies, stationery, groceries, and stock levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with meeting room bookings, ensure rooms are prepared for meetings, and provide general office support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support employees with workplace-related queries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Facilities &amp;amp; Security Support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor access to the office and follow workplace security procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report maintenance, housekeeping, and facilities issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with emergency notifications, evacuations, and incident response when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Employee Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support onboarding by welcoming new employees.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with office events and employee initiatives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- Requirements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in reception, office administration, or workplace coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and organisational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional, friendly, and service-oriented approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple tasks in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using Google Workspace and other workplace systems.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
