&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and dependable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive and customer-focused.&lt;/li&gt;
